1
00:00:00,122 --> 00:00:04,172
l'd smack you with a glove, but just last
week, I packed away my winter things.

2
00:00:05,461 --> 00:00:08,381
It's the 21 st century,
you can't have a duel.

3
00:00:08,589 --> 00:00:10,879
(Leonard:)Hang on, Howard.

4
00:00:13,386 --> 00:00:15,716
(Leonard:)Barry, how good of a shot are you?

5
00:00:16,389 --> 00:00:18,679
Not pistols. Minds.

6
00:00:18,891 --> 00:00:22,021
A trivia contest.
And you may choose the field of battle.

7
00:00:22,228 --> 00:00:25,318
Star Trek trivia,
Star Trek: Next Generation trivia...

8
00:00:25,523 --> 00:00:29,113
...Star Trek: Deep Space Nine trivia,
Star Trek: Voyagertrivia...

9
00:00:29,318 --> 00:00:31,608
...or model trains.

10
00:00:32,947 --> 00:00:35,907
You have an advantage in trivia.
You have an eidetic memory.

11
00:00:36,117 --> 00:00:37,827
Plus, I haven't watched Star Trek...

12
00:00:38,035 --> 00:00:41,955
...since I discovered the strip club
near my apartment has a free buffet.

13
00:00:43,207 --> 00:00:46,127
It's hard to find something
you're both equally good at.

14
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:48,375
ls there anything
you're equally bad at?

15
00:00:48,879 --> 00:00:50,839
- Sports.
- Sports.

16
00:00:54,135 --> 00:00:57,135
(Leonard:)All right, this is one-on-one,
first to five wins the office.

17
00:00:57,346 --> 00:00:59,056
(Leonard:)Any questions? Yes, Sheldon.

